  "id": "convite-revelacao-genero",
  "name": "Convite - Chá de Revelação (Misto) 🐳",
  "type": "outro",
  "category": "convites_festas",
  "format": "html",
  "content": "<div class=\"p-8 font-sans max-w-lg mx-auto bg-white text-zinc-800 rounded-3xl border border-neutral-200 relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n  <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50/30 via-transparent to-pink-50/30 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n  <div class=\"text-center relative z-10 space-y-6\">\n    <div class=\"text-5xl animate-pulse\">🧸❓🧁</div>\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-black uppercase text-zinc-900 tracking-tight leading-none\">\n      Menino ou Menina?\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 tracking-widest uppercase font-mono\">Chá Revelação da Família {{sobrenome_familia}}</p>\n    <p class=\"text-sm max-w-sm mx-auto text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed\">\n      Nossos corações estão transbordando de ansiedade! Junte-se a nós para descobrir qual cor vai colorir o céu da nossa vida! 💙 ou 💗?\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 divide-x divide-zinc-200 border-y border-zinc-200 py-4 my-2\">\n      <div class=\"pr-2\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-blue-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">Time Azul</span>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-600\">Palpite: Menino</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pl-2\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-pink-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">Time Rosa</span>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-600\">Palpite: Menina</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-center\">\n      <div class=\"bg-neutral-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-neutral-100\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-neutral-400 uppercase\">Data Marcada</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-xs text-zinc-800 font-bold font-sans\">{{data_cha}}</strong>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-neutral-50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-neutral-100\">\n        <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-neutral-400 uppercase\">Hora Solene</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-xs text-zinc-800 font-bold font-sans\">{{hora_cha}} hs</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-zinc-50 p-3 rounded-xl text-center border border-zinc-100\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[9px] font-mono text-zinc-400 uppercase mb-1\">Nossa Reunião será no endereço</span>\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-800\">{{local_cha}}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pt-2 text-center text-xs\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[9px] text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-mono mb-2\">Venha vestido com a sua torcida!</span>\n      <a href=\"https://wa.me/{{Whats_Confirmacao}}\" class=\"inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 to-rose-400 hover:from-sky-500 hover:to-rose-500 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider py-2.5 px-6 rounded-full transition shadow-md\">\n        Confirmar Palpite no Zap 📲\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
  "createdAt": "2026-06-17T14:51:34.182Z",
